# The Retroid pad (ROCKNIX's retroid serdev driver) reports BTN_BACK (0x116)
# besides its gamepad buttons, and that code is in the mouse button range
# (BTN_MOUSE..BTN_JOYSTICK): input_id (60-input-id.rules) then takes a device
# with ABS_X/ABS_Y and a mouse button for an absolute mouse and never tags it
# ID_INPUT_JOYSTICK. RetroArch's udev joypad driver and SDL look for joysticks
# only; under spruce RetroArch listed the pad as "Mouse/Touch" and no control
# worked in a game.
ACTION!="remove", SUBSYSTEM=="input", ATTRS{name}=="Retroid Pocket Gamepad", ENV{ID_INPUT_MOUSE}="", ENV{ID_INPUT_JOYSTICK}="1"
